---
const repo = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO;
const repoId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID;
const category = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY;
const categoryId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID;
const configured = Boolean(repo && repoId && category && categoryId);
const icon = '<svg class="action-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/></svg>';
---
<section class="discussion" aria-labelledby="discussion-heading">
  <h2 id="discussion-heading">댓글</h2>
  {configured ? (
    <div data-discussion data-repo={repo} data-repo-id={repoId} data-category={category} data-category-id={categoryId}>
      <p data-status aria-live="polite">GitHub 계정으로 댓글을 남길 수 있어요. 버튼을 누르기 전에는 외부 위젯을 불러오지 않습니다.</p>
      <div class="discussion-actions">
        <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-open hidden><Fragment set:html={icon} /><span>댓글 열기</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="giscus"></div>
    </div>
  ) : (
    <p>댓글은 GitHub Discussions 연결을 마치면 열립니다.</p>
  )}
</section>
